age","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"`rows.Columns` で何が入ってるか確かめて、Scanで受け取るための場所作るんだよね。","ts":"1618539005.018600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["UG6DF6W87"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qrY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"26a9e7ce-a7ce-48ef-8470-397843ada97c","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"プログラム的に全項目取りたいって時なら、そもそも `*` は使わないか `row.Scan` でいっぺんに取ることはしない。","ts":"1618538876.017800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SxgAT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"06957cee-4743-465c-9d9e-45c182cf551e","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"と気づいた","ts":"1618534091.016500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KDj67"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f7c17644-4250-4db7-8a24-581f6da843a9","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"ORMを使っていると順番とか気にしなくなるな","ts":"1618534087.016300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":3,"users":["US90LD360","UG6DF6W87","U01AQ5BFNLX"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wfVyD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3a584469-7b93-4d3d-9e28-38dfd9b9f202","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"あー、なるほど","ts":"1618534080.016100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Yyly5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4a5fa237-bced-4bd7-93f8-17f3d56ac0b0","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"// 減らしたらどっちでも動かなくなりますけどねｗ","ts":"1618533450.015800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"B=p2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"77dcc4e8-12a8-4ffc-b76e-8636c4853734","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"あとカラム増やしたら `*` だと動かなくなるけど、ちゃんと列挙してれば動く","ts":"1618533292.014800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4s0k"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9845e314-aa86-4c3a-96e1-a4c7da2745e3","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"```CREATE TABLE users (\n  id INT NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,\n  description VARCHAR(30) NOT NULL,\n  name VARCHAR(10) NOT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (id)\n);```\nみたいなテーブルを考えたときに\n```SELECT * from users```\nだと\n```rows.Scan(\u0026amp;id, \u0026amp;name, \u0026amp;description)```\nと\n```rows.Scan(\u0026amp;id, \u0026amp;description, \u0026amp;name)```\nのどちらが想定通りなのかはスキーマ読まないとわからないはず","ts":"1618532969.013900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tsr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9d0d2a69-c8a2-4fa8-a7d4-94dbc3411018","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"返ってくる順って、気にしたことがなかったなあ","ts":"1618532706.010200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"AeMJZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fef3247c-7fe1-456d-9bd5-bdd999cb7a47","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"順番で困っちゃいますね\n`*` だとスキーマと照らして何がどの順でくるんだっけ...ってやらないといけなくなる、はず","ts":"1618532597.008600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ns3es"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8dcaf7a0-f490-4f6b-a09d-3a7ebd2d8262","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"まぁ、あとはどこまで生SQL書くかって話になってくる","ts":"1618530650.005100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gMkr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4a60b541-5c50-4cb1-8ddb-0d7fdd117458","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"JOIN しないときは割と `*` で書いてるな","ts":"1618530532.004100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qlI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2430CAE9-C44D-4062-9AAB-5E5093A2BDF7","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"DB全然分からない\n皆さんの意見はどうですか？","ts":"1618530437.003500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_t